ansverse vaginal septum</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em> </em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>(1/30,000 \u2013 1/50,000)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1435]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Upper</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> (</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>A)</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>most</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> common 46%</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"10768c1c10552924c35a71ee\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-01-018\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 10768c1c10552924c35a71ee\" viewbox=\"-9525 -9525 2514600 2114550\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"3b739fb9e247fd5070b9450d127f26f8b6936c39877a4f4dbc2515e4fc85083e\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2491740 0 L 2491740 2089150 L 0 2089150 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-5b8b6a961a8bf9e3434d)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/