 sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> for 3-6</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>months</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> (</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>risk of damage to bladder </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>and rectum</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1440]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Risk of stenosis if </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>oulds</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> are</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> not used or sexually inactive</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1441]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pregnancy </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>rate </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>only</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>20% following t/m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> due to tubal damage that</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> has been </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>occurred</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> by hematosalpinx </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>and e</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ndometriosis d/t Backflow of b</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>lood</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1442]\" style=\"padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>c-section is recommended</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1443]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Middle</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> (B)</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1444]\" style=\"margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>30-40%</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of transverse septum</s